  <h1>FAQ</h1>
  <h2>Where is my order?</h2>
  <section>
    Once your order has shipped you can track your order by using the tracking number displayed above to track the
    progress of your shipment(s). If no tracking number appears within 4 days of your order, please
    <a href="javascript: void(0);" class="fd-contact-us hotlink ">Contact Us</a>.
  </section>
  <h2>How long will it take for me to receive my order?</h2>
  <section>
    For items that are available and on hand at our fulfillment centers, they should ship within 1-2 business days and
    be delivered within the below estimates, depending on the shipping method chosen at checkout.
  </section>
  <section>
    Current delivery times range from:
    <ul>
      <li>4-10 Business Days for Standard USPS Media Mail</li>
      <li>3-5 Business Days for USPS Priority</li>
      <li>3-6 Days for USPS Expedited</li>
      <li>2-6 Days for UPS Ground</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <h2>Where is my ebook?</h2>
  <section id="ebook-faq">
    Purchased ebooks should be available immediately in your
    <a href="https://bookshop.org/digital-library" class="hotlink underline">Ebook Library</a>, both on the website and in the mobile app.
    In some rare instances there may be a delay in ebook delivery. If your ebook is not in your Ebook Library within 4
    hours after placing an order please <a href="javascript: void(0);" class="fd-contact-us hotlink ">Contact Us</a>.
  </section>
  <h2>Can I cancel or change my order?</h2>
  <section>
    Currently, we are unable to cancel or adjust an order once it has been placed. We are currently working on solutions
    that should allow for greater flexibility for order adjustments and cancellations in the near future.
  </section>
  <h2>Can I change or cancel my backorder or preorder?</h2>
  <section>
    We can change the shipping address for pre-orders and backorders until they start processing to ship. We can also
    cancel unshipped pre-orders and backorders and provide a full refund.
  </section>
  <h2>When will my backorder ship?</h2>
  <section>
    Backorders are ordered from the publisher, and if they arrive within 90 days, we will ship them off to you. If we
    don’t receive them within this window, we will cancel your backorder and refund you.
  </section>
  <h2>Why have I received some of my items but not all of it?</h2>
  <section>
    Sometimes because of varying stock levels across our partner warehouses, orders can be split into two or more
    shipments. Please refer to the tracking numbers indicated alongside your order items to determine if your missing
    items are being shipped in a separate shipment. Backorders and pre-orders will often ship separately, and will not
    hold up the shipment of the rest of your order.
  </section>
  <h2>It’s been a while and my order has not arrived. What do I do?</h2>
  <section>
    We ask that you first review your tracking information above to determine if your shipment/s have been lost, stalled
    indefinitely, returned or are just delayed. If it seems that your item is no longer on its way to you or has been
    lost or stolen please
    <a href="javascript: void(0);" class="fd-contact-us hotlink ">contact our customer service team</a>
    and we will do everything we can to rectify the situation.
  </section>
  <h2>I am missing an item or an item I received is incorrect, damaged, or faulty. What do I do?</h2>
  <section>
    Please
    <a href="javascript: void(0);" class="fd-contact-us hotlink ">contact our customer service team</a>
    immediately and we will either replace or refund the missing or faulty item.
  </section>
